| menu-item-click | 菜单项点击时触发       | <code v-pre>key: string</code>                                                |
| sub-menu-click  | 子菜单点击时触发       | <code v-pre>key: string</code><br/><code v-pre>openKeys:string[]</code>                        |     |</p>
